{
  "folder": "0Wss47OeUBckZUjf",
  "name": "Growing Ferocity",
  "type": "feature",
  "img": "icons/creatures/abilities/bear-roar-bite-brown-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain certain benefits in combat based on the amount of ferocity you have. These benefits last until the end of your turn, even if a benefit would become unavailable to you because of the amount of ferocity you spend during your turn. Some Growing Ferocity benefits can be applied only if you are a specific level or higher, with the level of those benefits noted in the various Growing Ferocity tables in this section.</p><table><thead><tr><th><p>Ferocity</p></th><th><p>Benefit</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Whenever you use the Knockback maneuver, the forced movement distance gains a [[/apply sMnPGxuE2lVGqWOf]]{bonus equal to your Might score}.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>The first time you push a creature on a turn, you [[/surge 1]].</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>You gain an [[/apply LsDas4YTxb8dw3WP]]{edge} on Might tests and the Knockback maneuver</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8 (4th Level)</p></td><td><p>The first time you push a creature on a turn, you [[/surge 2]].</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10 (7th Level)</p></td><td><p>You have a [[/apply GHT8Tooakz5DvxgE]]{double edge} on Might tests and the Knockback maneuver.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>12 (10th Level)</p></td><td><p>Whenever you use a heroic ability, you gain [[/heal 10 temporary]]. Additionally, whenever you make a power roll that imposes forced movement on a target, the forced movement distance gains a bonus equal to [[lookup @M]]{your Might score}.</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "director": ""
    },
    "source": {
      "book": "Heroes",
      "page": "132",
      "license": "Draw Steel Creator License"
    },
